OL,3,GNEWSAFirm should not get crash
OL,4,Arecordings, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company responsible for the
OL,7,Fhelicopter that crashed outside
OL,8,FLeicester City's stadium, killing the
OL,9,Fclub's owner and four others, should
OL,10,Fnot be given recordings of the flight's
OL,11,Ffinal moments, the High Court has been
OL,12,Ftold.
OL,14,FThe club's owner Vichai
OL,15,FSrivaddhanaprabha was killed in the
OL,16,Fcrash alongside pilot Eric Swaffer, his
OL,17,Fpartner and co-pilot Izabela Lechowicz,
OL,18,Fand passengers Nusara Suknami and
OL,19,FKaveporn Punpare.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
