OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFirm should not get crash
OL,4,Arecordings, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FVichai's family is seeking compensation
OL,7,Fand damages from Italian aerospace
OL,8,Fgiant Leonardo S.p.A. valued at
OL,9,F#2.15bn.
OL,11,FLeonardo said it needs the flight data
OL,12,Fto defend the claim, while lawyers for
OL,13,Fthe family called the request a
OL,14,F"fishing expedition".
